contract operate-modeled-union-dimension

provider urn:ame:modeled-union-dimension

accepts a strictly chain-ordered sequence of witnessed SemioticExchange events + canonical decoded RMN carriers
reconstructs cell, demand, offer, purchase, settlement, role, and causal-following loci from those events only
joins explicit positive and negative SemioticSupportClaim carriers pointwise in the FOUR knowledge order
projects an admitted NodeWorkspaceSourceCatalogReceipt through one explicit witnessed observer family D into void, positive-bulk, negative-bulk, and interface sections
retains the territory, manifest, classification, observer-assertion, and finite-closure content addresses on every projected section
projects admitted NotebookLMLibraryCatalogReceipt carriers as content-addressed L-space notebook loci without retaining provider locators, credentials, or source contents
offers a notebook query only at one witnessed L-space locus and invokes the existing NotebookLM inference-team live-library operation through a private-custody actuator
returns each answered query as a canonical LSpaceNotebookQueryReceipt bound to notebook, source set, query digest, provider-operation witness, citations, and typed claims
joins citation-bound positive and negative L-space claims in FOUR while assigning notebook answers no truth, mutation, governance, or execution authority
reports only the strict-finite closure regime this finite FOUR projection witnesses and exposes the missing filtration/cofinality obstruction for every higher regime
recognizes complete successful X402SettlementEvidence without treating payment evidence as settlement authority
projects for one actor only the typed SemioticExchange operations enabled by the reconstructed position
marks every projected operation unavailable until the zero-custody SemioticExchange append actuator is composed
returns an active ModeledUnionDimensionPresentation derived from witnessed events and never a persisted voxel

refuses unordered or unknown events, displaced roles and offers, malformed support or settlement carriers, observer commitments outside the admitted territory, unwitnessed or displaced notebook queries, citations outside the admitted source set, browser-authored topology, snapshot or notebook-summary authority, recursive shape scans, eager workspace crawls, invented higher-regime evidence, and every requested write while the append actuator is unavailable
